{"sectionId":"gene/translation","items":[{"id":"gene--translation-k001","sectionId":"gene/translation","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"코돈은 mRNA 5′→3′ 방향의 세 염기 단위다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--translation-k002","sectionId":"gene/translation","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"표준 유전암호에서 AUG는 Met 및 흔한 개시코돈이고 UAA,UAG,UGA는 종결코돈이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--translation-k003","sectionId":"gene/translation","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"aminoacyl-tRNA synthetase는 ATP를 이용해 적절한 아미노산을 tRNA 3′ CCA에 부착한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--translation-k004","sectionId":"gene/translation","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"wobble은 코돈 세 번째 위치와 anticodon 첫 위치에서의 유연한 짝짓기를 설명한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--translation-k005","sectionId":"gene/translation","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"세균 리보솜은 Shine–Dalgarno 서열을 인식하고 진핵세포에서는 흔히 cap 의존적 scanning과 Kozak 문맥이 개시에 중요하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--translation-k006","sectionId":"gene/translation","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"리보솜 A 자리는 새 aminoacyl-tRNA, P 자리는 peptidyl-tRNA, E 자리는 나가는 tRNA에 해당한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--translation-k007","sectionId"